{"step_index":157,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-18T18:19:17Z","thinking":"**Documenting New Features**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `walkthrough.md` file. I'm documenting the new features, specifically the Contact Profile & Timeline Screen, along with Global Settings and local storage for the Gemini API key. I'm also ensuring to include the DNC suppression feature, which spans across all power dialing functionality.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Complete feature walkthrough for the SnapDialer power dialer application including all 7 screens, DNC suppression, multi-touch cadence engine, timeline logging, and Gemini Vision extraction.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: \"Snap-to-Dial\" Mobile Power Dialer (Comprehensive Build)\n\nThe full, production-ready codebase for **SnapDialer** has been constructed at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer).\n\nThe app runs on **iOS, Android, and Desktop Web** with a **\\$0.00 backend hosting cost** model powered by an offline-first **Universal SQLite / Local Persistence Engine**.\n\n---\n\n## Complete Feature Matrix\n\n### 1. AI Document Ingestion & Vision Parser ([`ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx))\n- **Live Camera Capture:** Snaps paper lead sheets, open-house sign-in forms, or handwritten rosters.\n- **Multimodal AI Structured Extractor:** Uses Gemini 2.5 Flash Vision to extract `{ name, phone, company, notes }` with phone number validation.\n- **CSV & Text Import:** Uploads spreadsheets or CSV text directly.\n- **Interactive Verification Table:** Allows inline editing, adding, or deleting rows before saving.\n- **Instant Demo Sheet:** 1-click test button for instant testing.\n\n### 2. Supercharged Power Dialer HUD ([`DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx))\n- **Active Queue Manager:** Shows contact name, phone, company, notes, and attempt badge (`Attempt #2`).\n- **Live Talk-Time Meter:** Real-time call duration tracker.\n- **Giant 1-Tap Outcome Grid:**\n  - 🚫 **No Answer / VM Drop:** Logs attempt, evaluates cadence rules, triggers follow-up SMS, and advances.\n  - ⚡ **Bad Number:** Disqualifies lead and removes from active queue.\n  - 💬 **Quick Text:** Opens multi-template SMS modal with dynamic tokens (`{{name}}`, `{{company}}`).\n  - 🤝 **Connected:** Opens quick-notes modal to record deal notes.\n- **Do Not Call (DNC) Suppression:** 1-tap button to permanently suppress a contact across all dialing sessions.\n- **Pacing Engine:** Auto-advance countdown timer with 1-tap pause control.\n\n### 3. Lead Profile & Timeline ([`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx))\n- View and edit individual contact records.\n- Complete chronological call history timeline (timestamps, talk time, dispositions, notes, and sent SMS bodies).\n- Quick Call, Text, and DNC action triggers.\n\n### 4. Cadence & Dynamic SMS Engine ([`CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx))\n- Configurable multi-touch follow-up rules (e.g. *Attempt #1: Call Only $\\rightarrow$ Attempt #2: Call + Follow-up SMS if unanswered*).\n- Customizable dynamic SMS templates with tag guide (`{{name}}`, `{{company}}`, `{{my_name}}`).\n\n### 5. List Management & Campaign Recycling ([`ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx))\n- Completion progress bars and connect rate counters.\n- Expandable lead lists with search bar and disposition filter chips (`All`, `Pending`, `No Answer`, `Connected`).\n- **Recycle Unanswered Leads:** 1-click button to reset unanswered leads for the next dialing cadence attempt.\n\n### 6. Analytics & Data Export ([`AnalyticsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/AnalyticsScreen.tsx))\n- Real-time connect rate %, dials breakdown, and JSON/CSV share sheet export.\n\n### 7. Global App Settings ([`SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx))\n- Persistent Gemini API Key storage.\n- Custom Caller Signature (`{{my_name}}`).\n- Pacing controls (toggle auto-advance on/off, customize countdown seconds).\n- Active DNC list management.\n","Description":"Updated walkthrough artifact covering all 7 screens, DNC management, timeline logging, and feature matrix","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Writing updated walkthrough","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md"}}]}
