{"step_index":159,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-18T18:19:22Z","content":"The entire **SnapDialer** application suite is now complete and fully built across all 7 core modules.\n\n---\n\n### What Was Just Built:\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                          COMPLETE FEATURE ARCHITECTURE                      │\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                                             │\n│  1. Scan & Ingest (ScanSheetScreen.tsx)                                     │\n│     • Camera photo capture + CSV/Text file import                           │\n│     • Multimodal Gemini 2.5 Flash Vision parser with duplicate detection    │\n│     • Interactive Editable Verification Table with row add/edit/delete      │\n│                                                                             │\n│  2. Flagship Power Dialer HUD (DialerHudScreen.tsx)                         │\n│     • Giant 1-Tap Outcomes (No Answer/VM, Connected, Quick Text, Bad #)     │\n│     • Live talk-time meter & call timer                                     │\n│     • 1-Tap Do Not Call (DNC) suppression button                            │\n│     • Multi-template SMS selector modal with dynamic tokens                 │\n│     • Configurable auto-advance countdown timer (Pause / Next)              │\n│                                                                             │\n│  3. Lead Profile & Timeline (LeadDetailScreen.tsx)                          │\n│     • Full contact profile with inline editor                               │\n│     • Chronological call attempt timeline (duration, outcome, notes, SMS)   │\n│                                                                             │\n│  4. Cadence & Dynamic SMS Engine (CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx)                │\n│     • Multi-touch sequence builder (Attempt #1 -> Attempt #2 + SMS)         │\n│     • Dynamic template editor ({{name}}, {{company}}, {{my_name}})          │\n│                                                                             │\n│  5. List Management & Recycling (ListsScreen.tsx)                           │\n│     • Expandable lists with instant search & disposition filters            │\n│     • 1-Click \"Recycle Unanswered Leads\" for next cadence attempt           │\n│                                                                             │\n│  6. Analytics & Share Export (AnalyticsScreen.tsx)                          │\n│     • Connect rate %, dials breakdown, JSON/CSV export                      │\n│                                                                             │\n│  7. Global App Settings (SettingsScreen.tsx)                                │\n│     • Persistent Gemini Vision API key storage                              │\n│     • Caller identity & auto-advance countdown configuration                │\n│     • Master DNC phone registry                                             │\n│                                                                             │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Key Files in Your Codebase:\n\n- 📱 **Screens:**\n  - [`src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ListsScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/ScanSheetScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/CadenceSettingsScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/AnalyticsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/AnalyticsScreen.tsx)\n  - [`src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/SettingsScreen.tsx)\n- 🗄️ **Database & Repositories:**\n  - [`src/db/database.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/database.ts) (Universal SQLite + Web Local Storage)\n  - [`src/db/leadsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/leadsRepository.ts)\n  - [`src/db/callLogsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/callLogsRepository.ts)\n  - [`src/db/cadenceRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/cadenceRepository.ts)\n  - [`src/db/settingsRepository.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/db/settingsRepository.ts)\n- ⚙️ **Services & Navigation:**\n  - [`src/services/visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts)\n  - [`src/services/telephonyService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/telephonyService.ts)\n  - [`src/services/cadenceEngine.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/cadenceEngine.ts)\n  - [`src/navigation/AppNavigator.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/navigation/AppNavigator.tsx)\n\nIf you refresh your web browser at `http://localhost:8081`, you can test and explore every single screen, feature, and workflow immediately!"}
